sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Act as Actor
    participant GW as ToolGateway
    participant PE as PolicyEngine
    participant RG as ToolRegistry
    participant T as Tool handler
    participant ST as ToolCallStore
    participant SSE as SSE Bus

    Act->>GW: call(tool_name, arguments, capability, task_id, ctx)
    GW->>PE: authorize(capability, tool_name, args)
    Note over PE: WhitelistRule：工具已注册 + agent 有权限<br/>BashExecGuardRule：按工具生效的规则
    PE-->>GW: 通过，否则抛 TOOL_NOT_AUTHORIZED
    GW->>ST: append(status=RUNNING, arguments=_redact(args))
    Note over ST: authorization / x-api-key / cookie 脱敏
    GW->>RG: get_from_capability(tool_name, capability)
    RG-->>GW: ToolDefinition
    GW->>T: handler(arguments, call_ctx)
    T-->>GW: ToolResult（异常转为 is_error=True）
    GW->>ST: append(status=SUCCEEDED / FAILED)
    GW->>SSE: push(tool_call 事件)
    GW->>GW: 超过 http_response_limit_bytes 则截断
    GW-->>Act: ToolResult
